- id: TC_SRCH_001
  module: masters
  title: Item search - naam ka hissa daalne pe item milna chahiye
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - smoke
  - search
  expected:
  - Grid me sirf matching item rahe
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: assert_text
    value: Item List
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: Sample
  - action: sleep
    value: '2'
  - action: assert_text
    value: Sample
  preconditions:
  - 'NOTE: poora naam ''Sample Item'' search karne par natija nahi aata, jabki ''Samp''
    se aata hai. Ye MargBooks ka sambhavit bug hai -- test jaanbujh kar waisa hi rakha
    hai taaki dikhta rahe.'
- id: TC_SRCH_002
  module: masters
  title: Item search - aadha naam daalne pe bhi match aana chahiye
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - search
  expected:
  - Partial text pe bhi result mile
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: Samp
  - action: sleep
    value: 2
  - action: assert_text
    value: Sample
- id: TC_SRCH_003
  module: masters
  title: Item search - jo cheez hai hi nahi uspe saaf empty state aaye, crash nahi
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - search
  - negative
  expected:
  - Koi row na dikhe
  - Error/blank screen na aaye
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: ZZQQXX_NOT_EXIST_9999
  - action: sleep
    value: 2
  - action: assert_no_text
    value: Sample Item
  - action: assert_no_text
    value: Error
- id: TC_SRCH_004
  module: masters
  title: Item search - special characters se app crash nahi hona chahiye
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - search
  - negative
  - security
  expected:
  - App normal rahe, koi JS error ya blank page na aaye
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: '''<>%&*()_+'
  - action: sleep
    value: 2
  - action: assert_text
    value: Item List
- id: TC_SRCH_005
  module: masters
  title: Item search - clear karne pe list wapas aani chahiye
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - search
  expected:
  - Search khali karte hi saare items dobara dikhein
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: ZZQQXX_NOT_EXIST_9999
  - action: sleep
    value: '2'
  - action: assert_text
    value: Not Found
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: ''
  - action: sleep
    value: '3'
  - action: assert_text
    value: Total no of items
  preconditions:
  - 'NOTE: poora naam ''Sample Item'' search karne par natija nahi aata, jabki ''Samp''
    se aata hai. Ye MargBooks ka sambhavit bug hai -- test jaanbujh kar waisa hi rakha
    hai taaki dikhta rahe.'
- id: TC_SRCH_006
  module: masters
  title: Ledger search - naam se party dhoondhna
  priority: p1
  tags:
  - smoke
  - search
  expected:
  - Matching ledger grid me dikhe
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: party
    note: Menu se party kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: assert_text
    value: Ledger Master
  - action: fill
    target: party.search
    value: Cash Account
  - action: sleep
    value: 2
  - action: assert_text
    value: Cash Account
- id: TC_SRCH_007
  module: masters
  title: Ledger search - chhote-bade akshar se farak nahi padna chahiye
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - search
  expected:
  - '''cash account'' aur ''CASH ACCOUNT'' dono same result dein'
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: party
    note: Menu se party kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: party.search
    value: cash account
  - action: sleep
    value: 2
  - action: assert_text
    value: Cash
- id: TC_SRCH_008
  module: masters
  title: Search By dropdown badalne pe wahi field search ho
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - search
  preconditions:
  - Ledger Master pe 'Search By' dropdown hai (Name/Mobile/GSTIN...)
  expected:
  - Mobile pe search karne se naam nahi milna chahiye
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: party
    note: Menu se party kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: select
    target: party.search_by
    value: Mobile
  - action: fill
    target: party.search
    value: Cash Account
  - action: sleep
    value: '2'
  - action: assert_text
    value: Not Found
    note: Mobile field me naam nahi milna chahiye
- id: TC_SRCH_009
  module: masters
  title: Item search - poora naam daalne pe bhi item milna chahiye
  priority: p2
  tags:
  - search
  known_issue: true
  preconditions:
  - 'KNOWN ISSUE: ''Sample'' se item milta hai par ''Sample Item'' (poora naam) se
    ''Not Found!'' aata hai. Ye MargBooks ka sambhavit bug hai. Test jaanbujh kar
    rakha hai taaki theek hone par apne aap pass ho jaye.'
  expected:
  - Poora naam daalne pe bhi wahi item milna chahiye
  steps:
  - action: open_screen
    target: item
    note: Menu se item kholo (URL se nahi)
  - action: fill
    target: item.search
    value: Sample Item
  - action: sleep
    value: '2'
  - action: assert_no_text
    value: Not Found
